<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 00:13:53 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a77c63e82706</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一只玳瑁三花猫坐在木地板上，抬头望向我们上方，身旁放着一个玩具。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Tortico cat looking up above us sitting next to a toy on a wooden floor." height="1332" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hp/6a77c63e82706.jpg" width="2000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hp.some.pics"&gt;@hp&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 00:13:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a77ae9633d48</link><description>&lt;p&gt;最后生还者 第一章&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Last of Us" height="5660" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/damo/6a77ae9633d48.jpg" width="4240"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://damo.some.pics"&gt;@damo&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 22:32:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>防火熊被撤资：自求多福</title><link>https://some.pics/6a77a4a474aae</link><description>&lt;p&gt;两格斯莫基熊表情包：上方是欢快的防火宣传标语，下方则是一只眼神狂野的斯莫基熊坦白说他们已被撤资，你只能自求多福了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Two-panel Smokey Bear meme. Top: classic Smokey in his ranger hat saying &amp;quot;Only YOU can prevent forest fires!&amp;quot; Bottom: a wide-eyed, frazzled close-up of Smokey saying &amp;quot;No, I'm being serious. We're defunded so you're on your own.&amp;quot;" height="1208" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/milo/6a77a4a474aae.jpg" width="1236"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://milo.some.pics"&gt;@milo&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 21:50:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a779b2265ef8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;存在。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Beest. " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a779b2265ef8.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 21:09:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>晨光中的美丽入侵花</title><link>https://some.pics/6a77712988f25</link><description>&lt;p&gt;清晨光线中的喜马拉雅凤仙花。我知道它是入侵物种，但还是忍不住觉得它很美。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Tall purple flowers of Himalayan balsam sparkle in the early morning sun among lush green undergrowth. The scene is framed by the trunk and branch of a tree. " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/bsag/6a77712988f25.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://bsag.some.pics"&gt;@bsag&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 18:11:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>